    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Bad Eden ancestry.</strong> This item keeps the original species UUID while fitting the ancestry-root layer of the new identity stack.</p><p><strong>Echo-Diver.</strong> Vestigial Sparkborn whose bodies reflect timelines that never fully collapsed. Echo-Divers experience micro-moments of precognition, flicker-step displacement, and surge conduction. Their physiology resonates with Spark, Radiation, and chronoflux anomalies—making them uncanny scouts, investigators, and hazard specialists.</p><hr /><p><em><strong>Echo-Diver Traits</strong></em></p><ul><li><strong>Creature Type.</strong> Humanoid (Echo-Diver).</li><li><strong>Size.</strong> You are Medium.</li><li><strong>Speed.</strong> Your walking speed is 30 feet.</li><li><strong>Ability Scores.</strong> Your background determines your ability score increases; Echo-Diver does not grant any ability score bonuses.</li></ul><p>Your Echo-Diver heritage grants you a suite of additional features through advancements (Item Grants) added during character creation.</p><p class=\"ft-heritages-line\"><strong>Heritages:</strong> Abyssal, Empyrean, Tellurian.</p>",
